\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Proposed FrontierMax step.} The teacher samples requested prompts by \(\nu _N\). A live requested group uses the practical estimator. For an all-fail group, the relabeler selects one common destination, rewrites and reverifies the group, and updates only if the destination group has contrast \(0<K'<N\). The resulting update is verified but generally off-policy for the destination. Posterior state is updated only from requested-task outcomes.}}{6}{figure.24}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:algorithm}{{2}{6}{\textbf {Proposed FrontierMax step.} The teacher samples requested prompts by \(\nu _N\). A live requested group uses the practical estimator. For an all-fail group, the relabeler selects one common destination, rewrites and reverifies the group, and updates only if the destination group has contrast \(0<K'<N\). The resulting update is verified but generally off-policy for the destination. Posterior state is updated only from requested-task outcomes}{figure.24}{}}
